OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FUkraine-born Vadym Kholodenko
OL,7,     Fplays Rachmaninov's second piano
OL,8,     Fconcerto with the BBC National
OL,9,     FOrchestra of Wales. The programme
OL,10,     Fstarts with Bacewicz's Concerto
OL,11,     Ffor String Orchestra.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FLive from Horsey Windpump, Tom
OL,14,     Fexplores the Norfolk Broads
OL,15,     Fthrough the music and people of
OL,16,     Fthe area. With music inspired by
OL,17,     Fthe sea from Olivia Chaney.
OL,18,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,19,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,20,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,21,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,22,     Fwith familiar favourites.
