OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FAl Ryan introduces Debussy & Liszt
OL,7,     Ffrom the Royal Liverpool
OL,8,     FPhilharmonic Orchestra, plus
OL,9,     FBeethoven from the Chaos Quartet
OL,10,     Fand pianist Julius Asal playing
OL,11,     FBartok & Schumann.
OL,12,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FLive from the Chapel of Clare
OL,14,     FCollege, Cambridge, with music by
OL,15,     FJohn Rutter, Howells, Nico Muhly
OL,16,     Fand Hovland.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,18,     F3/5. Donald Macleod presents
OL,19,     Fmusical works ascribed to named
OL,20,     Fcomposers whose true authors have
OL,21,     Fbeen hidden, confused, and even
OL,22,     Fdeliberately obscured.
