OL,5,G2145 Between the Ears: Miniatures
OL,6,G     (Midsummer Dreaming)
OL,7,     FAn invitation to reflect on how
OL,8,     Fthe Sun's movements can remind us
OL,9,     Fto slow down.
OL,10,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,11,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Feverything in between.
OL,16,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,17,     FSoweto welcomes back jazz pianist
OL,18,     Fand composer Nduduzo Makhathini to
OL,19,     Fshare his third 4/4 selection of
OL,20,     Fthe week.
